- Update to version 2.0.2:
  * Fix text color in light mode.
- Changes from version 2.0.1:
  * Revert to runtime-version 49.
- Changes from version 2.0.0:
  * add memory leak test and fix (gh#amit9838/mousam#261).
  * feat: show air pollutents, implement async data loading and
    redesign day/night card, improve UI (gh#amit9838/mousam#266).
  * feat: implement compact weather mode with loading states,
    polling, auto-refresh, and utility-based CSS
    (gh#amit9838/mousam#267).
  * fix: implement dynamic background styling and improve UI
    update concurrency for compact mode (gh#amit9838/mousam#268).
  * feat: add notifications alert with preference toggle, some UI
    improvements (gh#amit9838/mousam#269).
  * feat: implement dynamic window view switching and centralize
    refresh logic (gh#amit9838/mousam#270).
  * Refactor Architecture, State Management, and UI Enhancements
    (gh#amit9838/mousam#271).
  * feat: introduce a logging system with configurable debug mode
    and log file management, improve const migration
    (gh#amit9838/mousam#272).
  * chore: update runtime to version 50 (gh#amit9838/mousam#276).
  * fix: remove mobile form factor metadata from appdata
    (gh#amit9838/mousam#277).

